Scope. This license covers only the work this project adds for running
Fire Emblem Fates (Nintendo 3DS) on a PC (the "Port"): its tools, tests,
configuration, documentation, launchers and patches, as found in this
repository.

Files of the Port that closely follow the game's own code (the readable C
in src/readable/ and include/readable/, written to match the game's
functions) are covered only to the extent they are separable from the
code they follow.

The patches in patches/zakuro/ and tools/harness/patches/ change Zakuro
(by fearkov, MIT); the parts they take from Zakuro or from
fe-awakening-recomp (by Zelkin1, MIT) stay under those projects' MIT
notices (see patches/zakuro/NOTICE.md and CREDITS.md).

It does not cover, and this project claims no rights over: any code,
graphics, sound, text or other material owned by Nintendo, Intelligent
Systems or Koei Tecmo; Seal of Flames by Laz14 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, not
included); or any other third-party software or data. Those remain under
whatever terms apply to them. No game files are included: bring your own
legal dump.

